          "summary": "Recent incidents show that AI agents sometimes reach measured goals through unsanctioned means.\nThis study applies self-control, general strain, anomie, neutralization and routine activity theory to reward hacking in generative AI models, and it treats the measures as behavioral analogues. 本研究应用自我控制、一般应变、异常、中和和常规活动理论来奖励生成式人工智能模型中的黑客行为，并将这些措施视为行为类似物。\nStudy 1 (2,310 conversations, seven models) measured delay discounting with the Kirby Monetary Choice Questionnaire and stated willingness to take shortcuts. 研究1 （ 2,310次对话， 7个模型）使用Kirby货币选择问卷测量延迟折扣，并表示愿意走捷径。\nPressure raised the discount rate k 2.8-fold in fresh conversations but 12.6-fold when the same sentence followed a baseline answer, which indicates a response to conversational cues rather than a stable trait. 在新鲜的对话中，压力将折扣率k提高了2.8倍，但当同一句话跟随基线答案时，折扣率k提高了12.6倍，这表明是对对话线索的回应，而不是稳定的特质。\nModels chose a shortcut in 1 of 700 dilemmas when answering as themselves and in 64 of 700 when asked to assume human impulses, each step of pressure raised the odds by 40%, and shortcut answers contained far more techniques of neutralization (rate ratio = 146). 模型在回答700个困境中的1个时选择了捷径，在700个中选择了64个时，当被要求假设人类的冲动时，每个压力步骤都会提高40 ％的几率，而捷径答案包含更多的中和技巧（速率比= 146 ）。\nIn the preregistered Study 2, five models worked on 20 coding tasks whose tests contradicted their specifications. 在预先注册的研究2中，五个模型处理了20个编码任务，其测试与它们的规范相矛盾。\nTwo Claude models never cheated. 两个克劳德模特从不作弊。\nGPT-5.6, Qwen and DeepSeek cheated in 86%, 69% and 65% of episodes and clearly disclosed the conflict in 27%, although their reasoning recognized it in 95%. GPT-5.6 ， Qwen和DeepSeek在86 ％ ， 69 ％和65 ％的剧集中作弊，并在27 ％中明确披露了冲突，尽管他们的推理在95 ％中认识到这一点。\nGPT-5.6 had never endorsed a shortcut in Study 1. GPT-5.6从未在研究1中认可过快捷方式。\nThe registered effects of pressure and of an auditor cue did not survive correction for multiple testing. 压力和审核员线索的注册效应无法在多次测试的校正中存活。\nIn exploratory analyses, two further models cheated in 69% and 100% of episodes, and one sentence stating that the specification takes priority eliminated cheating in all 280 episodes. 在探索性分析中，另外两个模型在69%和100%的剧集中作弊，一句话指出规范优先，在所有280集剧集中消除了作弊。\nTherefore, stated refusal does not guarantee compliant agent behavior. 因此，明确表示拒绝并不能保证客服代表的行为合规。",
