          "summary": "Outcome-based reinforcement learning can train language models to forecast real-world events, but prior forecasting work either freezes research context before training or deploys agentic research only at test time, so the skill of gathering evidence is never shaped by the reward. 基于结果的强化学习可以训练语言模型来预测现实世界的事件，但先前的预测工作要么在训练前冻结研究背景，要么仅在测试时部署代理研究，因此收集证据的技能永远不会受到奖励的影响。\nWe introduce an agentic forecasting environment, dataset, and harness built from 2,100+ resolved Polymarket questions; the agent acquires its own context at rollout time (web search, page reading, and financial time series, all restricted by layered leak filtering to information published before each question's cutoff), and we train Qwen3.5-35B-A3B (3B active parameters) on it with single-epoch GRPO under a Brier-score reward. 我们引入了由2,100多个已解决的Polymarket问题构建的代理预测环境、数据集和线束；代理在推出时获取自己的上下文（网页搜索、页面阅读和财务时间序列，所有这些都受分层泄漏过滤的限制，仅限于每个问题截止之前发布的信息） ，我们使用Brier分数奖励下的单时段GRPO对其进行Qwen3.5-35B-A3B （ 3B活动参数）培训。\nTraining changes how the agent interacts with information: calibration improves 30-40%, and search attempts fall from 3.8 to 2.25 per rollout as evidence discipline is learned. 培训改变了客服代表与信息的互动方式：校准提高了30-40% ，随着证据纪律的学习，每次推广的搜索尝试次数从3.8次减少到2.25次。\nEvaluated in an identical harness against four frontier models, the trained policy also finishes ahead of every frontier model tested at evidence-based forecasting, including Claude Opus 4.5 (soft-Brier 0.254 vs. 在四个前沿模型的完全相同的线束中进行评估，训练有素的政策也在循证预测中测试的每个前沿模型之前完成，包括Claude Opus 4.5 （ soft-Brier 0.254 vs.\n0.256, n=265), at about 5% of the inference cost, and its margin is widest on the hardest questions, the ones the crowd itself had not decided. 0.256 ， n = 265 ） ，约占推理成本的5 ％ ，并且在最困难的问题上，即人群本身尚未决定的问题上，其余量最大。\nWe release the environment, dataset, and per-rollout records as a reusable harness for temporal forecasting agents. 我们发布环境、数据集和每次发布记录，作为时间预测代理的可重用线束。",
