          "summary": "Repeated praise, canned reassurance, familiar contrasts, and conspicuous vocabulary are recurring subjects in discussions of large language models. 在大型语言模型的讨论中，反复的赞美、罐装的保证、熟悉的对比和引人注目的词汇是反复出现的主题。\nTheir interpretation depends on context: a conventional phrase may be useful, while a fluent answer may reinforce a false belief. 他们的解释取决于上下文：传统的短语可能有用，而流利的答案可能会强化错误的信念。\nThis critical review examines linguistic habits and sycophancy across eight developer families: OpenAI, Anthropic, Google DeepMind, xAI, ByteDance, Moonshot AI, DeepSeek, and Xiaomi. 这篇重要评论考察了八个开发者家族的语言习惯和嗜好： OpenAI、Anthropic、Google DeepMind、xAI、ByteDance、Moonshot AI、DeepSeek和小米。\nWe verify current public offerings against official release and API documentation, with an evidence cutoff of 1 October 2026. 我们根据官方发布和API文档验证当前的公开募股，证据截止日期为2026年10月1日。\nWe synthesize research on lexical overrepresentation, stylistic variation, social warmth, and agreement, alongside benchmark methods and dated English and Chinese public discussions. 我们综合了有关词汇过度表达、风格变化、社会温暖和协议的研究，以及基准方法和过时的英文和中文公开讨论。\nThe research reviewed documents recurring linguistic patterns and agreement that distorts judgment; comparable measurements of the newest releases are sparse in the retrieved set. 该研究回顾了反复出现的语言模式和扭曲判断的一致性；在检索到的集合中，最新版本的可比测量值很少。\nCurrent user reports include both complaints and improved writing, with experiences varying by task and prompting. 当前的用户报告包括投诉和改进的写作，体验因任务和提示而异。\nWe propose separate measures of recurrence, contextual appropriateness, and belief distortion, with precise service records and language-specific annotation. 我们提出了复发、语境适当性和信念扭曲的单独措施，包括精确的服务记录和特定语言的注释。\nThis framework makes claims about writing quality and conversational reliability testable as model services change. 该框架使关于写作质量和会话可靠性的声明可以在模型服务发生变化时进行测试。",
